CACHE_MANAGER	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
DECLARED_SUSPENSION	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
ENV_VAR_OR_CUSTODY_KEY	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
LINT_MESSAGE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
MEMORY_CACHE_MANAGER	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
MISSING_CHAR	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
NA_REASON	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
PHASE_REASON	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
QUOTE_DOUBLE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
QUOTE_SINGLE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
REDIS_CACHE_MANAGER	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
SUPPRESSED_MESSAGE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
SUSPENSION_REASON	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
TOKEN_TOLERANCE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
UNEXPECTED_TOKEN	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
X_FILE	constant, parser token or key name, not an emitted code
AWAITING_OWNER_STATUS	an identifier used as a computed object key, not a code
